### Add-ons API Testing

### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

# ==================== ADD-ON MANAGEMENT ====================

### List All Add-ons
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Add-ons with Filters
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons?page=1&limit=10&isActive=true
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Filter by Type (Physical)
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons?type=PHYSICAL
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Filter by Type (Service)
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons?type=SERVICE
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Search Add-ons
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons?search=Label
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Add-on by ID
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create Physical Add-on
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ETEKITA",
  "name": "Etekita",
  "description": "Neck label with etekita material",
  "type": "PHYSICAL",
  "basePrice": 2.50,
  "materialId": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Service Add-on
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "VIP_HANDLING",
  "name": "VIP Handling",
  "description": "Priority processing for VIP customers",
  "type": "SERVICE",
  "basePrice": 10.00,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Update Add-on
PATCH {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Etekita Label - Premium",
  "basePrice": 3.00
}

###

### Delete Add-on
DELETE {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ==================== INCLUSION RULES ====================

### List All Inclusion Rules
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/rules/list
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create Inclusion Rule (Free if quantity >= 40)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addonId": 11,
  "ruleType": "MIN_QTY",
  "thresholdValue": 40,
  "discountPercent": 100,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Partial Discount Rule
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addonId": 12,
  "ruleType": "MIN_QTY",
  "thresholdValue": 50,
  "discountPercent": 50,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Update Inclusion Rule
PATCH {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/rules/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thresholdValue": 30,
  "discountPercent": 100
}

###

### Delete Inclusion Rule
DELETE {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/rules/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ==================== PRICING CALCULATOR ====================

### Calculate Add-on Pricing (Below threshold - paid)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/calculate-price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addons": [
    {
      "addonId": 11,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "addonId": 12,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "quantity": 30
}

###

### Calculate Add-on Pricing (Above threshold - free)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/calculate-price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addons": [
    {
      "addonId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "addonId": 2,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "quantity": 50
}

###

### Get Add-on with Rules
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/1/rules
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Check Eligibility (Not eligible)
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/1/check-eligibility?quantity=30
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Check Eligibility (Eligible for free)
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/1/check-eligibility?quantity=50
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ==================== SALES ORDER INTEGRATION ====================

### Create Sales Order with Add-ons
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test Customer with Add-ons",
  "orderDate": "2024-01-15",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "quantity": 50,
      "unitOfMeasureId": 1,
      "unitPrice": 10.00,
      "warehouseId": 1,
      "locationId": 1,
      "serviceTypeId": 1,
      "serviceOptionId": 1,
      "labelSource": "CUSTOMER",
      "addons": [
        {
          "addonId": 1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "notes": "Customer provided etekita"
        },
        {
          "addonId": 2,
          "quantity": 1,
          "notes": "Company provided hangtag"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###

### Create Sales Order with Add-ons (Below threshold)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test Customer - Small Order",
  "orderDate": "2024-01-15",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "quantity": 20,
      "unitOfMeasureId": 1,
      "unitPrice": 10.00,
      "warehouseId": 1,
      "locationId": 1,
      "addons": [
        {
          "addonId": 1,
          "quantity": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

