# ==================== ERROR TESTS ====================

### Test Error - Create Add-on with Duplicate Code
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ETEKITA",
  "name": "Duplicate Etekita",
  "type": "PHYSICAL",
  "basePrice": 2.50
}

###

### Test Error - Create Rule for Non-existent Add-on
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addonId": 99999,
  "ruleType": "MIN_QTY",
  "thresholdValue": 40,
  "discountPercent": 100
}

###

### Test Error - Access without Authentication
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Error - Invalid Add-on Type
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "INVALID",
  "name": "Invalid Type",
  "type": "INVALID_TYPE",
  "basePrice": 10.00
}

###

### Test Error - Negative Price
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/addons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NEGATIVE",
  "name": "Negative Price",
  "type": "PHYSICAL",
  "basePrice": -10.00
}

